{
  "$comment": "StumpWM's built-in default keybinds: the fill-keymap forms of bindings.lisp in nixpkgs' stumpwm (nixos-26.05) for the prefix maps of tile groups (the default group type): *root-map*, *group-root-map*, *tile-group-root-map*, *groups-map* (C-t g), *exchange-window-map* (C-t x) and *help-map* (C-t h). Every bind is behind the prefix C-t, so every accel is <Control>t and the label has the sequences; the action is `<keymap> <command>` (binds with the same command merged). Regenerate with scripts/keybinds/extract-x11-wms.py.",
